### PostgreSQL query
POST {{endpoint}}/api/commands HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: text/plain

POSTGRESQL QUERY "SELECT current_database(), current_user, version()" "{{postgresql_connectionstring}}"

### SQL Server execute (temporary table only)
POST {{endpoint}}/api/commands HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: text/plain

SQL EXECUTE "CREATE TABLE #network_tester (id int); INSERT INTO #network_tester VALUES (1), (2); DROP TABLE #network_tester;" "{{sql_connectionstring}}"

### PostgreSQL execute (rolled back)
POST {{endpoint}}/api/commands HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: text/plain

POSTGRESQL EXECUTE "BEGIN; CREATE TEMP TABLE network_tester (id int); INSERT INTO network_tester VALUES (1), (2); ROLLBACK;" "{{postgresql_connectionstring}}"

### PostgreSQL empty result
POST {{endpoint}}/api/commands HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: text/plain

POSTGRESQL QUERY "SELECT 1 AS value WHERE false" "{{postgresql_connectionstring}}"

